ROLE: product_realist  VOTE: red
REAL_USE_CASE: None identified. Long-horizon tool-calling agents do not exhibit the load-bearing cold-then-hot callback structure; real Qwen2.5-1.5B traces show critical handle spans are heavy-hitters from commit (attention rank 0.50→1.00, never cold), so the scenario the CAUSAL predictor targets does not occur in production agent transcripts.
OPERATIONAL_SIGNIFICANCE: Microbenchmark-only artifact. The L0 win required an engineered sim structure absent from real LLM attention; L1 measures cold_then_hot fraction = 0.000 (threshold ≥15% meaningful, <5% rare) across 806 real spans, H2O future-ref AUC = 0.999/0.819 overall and 1.000 on critical handles, and CAUSAL vs H2O pass@1 = +0.00 [CI 0,0] at every budget. The advantage vanishes against a real paged kernel (H2O) that already retains the heavy-hitter.
ADOPTION_BARRIER: [Premise fails in real traces (0% cold-then-hot); H2O already achieves perfect critical-span retention (AUC 1.000, retention 1.00); noisy lexical proxy is weaker than H2O (0.857/0.647 vs 0.999/0.819) and redundant; engineering cost for span-boundary detection and lexical indexing buys zero task-success delta; prior art (A2SF, ArkVale recallable KV, Quest query-aware, Apple Learning to Evict) already addresses biased attention and delayed recall without a lexical handle signal; negative result is actionable guidance to not build]
RATIONALE: L1 EXP-0013 refutes the load-bearing hypothesis: cold_then_hot frac = 0.000 in both easy (242 spans) and hard (564 spans) designs, crit cold_early = 0.000, crit hot_later = 1.000, crit mean early_rank = 0.750 (packet §1). Real H2O accumulated attention AUC = 0.999 (easy) / 0.819 (hard) overall, 1.000 critical-handle; lexical proxy = 0.857/0.647 (weaker) (packet §2). End-to-end pass@1: CAUSAL − H2O = +0.00 [0,0] at all budgets; H2O retains heavy-hitter, only recency-truncation loses (packet §3). Prior-art sweep confirms A2SF (biased-attention diagnosis), ArkVale (recallable KV via query geometry, no lexical signal), Quest/InfiniGen (query-aware), Apple Learning to Evict (past-attention is indirect proxy for future value), and Scissorhands persistence-of-importance (packet §4). The L0 win was an artifact of engineered sim structure absent from real LLM attention (packet VERDICT).
